        "filing_date": "2026-03-04",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We intend to continue expanding our sales and marketing efforts to grow our share of advertising budgets from existing marketers and attract new brands, merchants and service providers, both directly and through advertising agencies.",
